     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
     xmlns:ontology="http://dbpedia.org/ontology/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ekp/owl/Airline.owl">
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/schemas/cpannotationschema.owl"/>
        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To represent the encyclopedic knowledge expressed by an object typed as Airline</dcterms:description>
        <dcterms:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Airline.owl Pattern</dcterms:title>
        <ns1:extractedFrom rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/"/>
        <ns1:extractedFrom rdf:resource="http://en.wikipedia.org/"/>
        <ns1:hasAuthor>Aldo Gangemi</ns1:hasAuthor>
        <ns1:hasAuthor>Andrea Giovanni Nuzzolese</ns1:hasAuthor>
        <ns1:hasAuthor>Valentina Presutti</ns1:hasAuthor>
        <ns1:hasIntent rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To represent the encyclopedic knowledge expressed by an object typed as Airline</ns1:hasIntent>
        <rdfs:comment>Airline Encyclopedic Knowledge Pattern</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK&apos;s quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label moved to skos:prefLabel x3; label added x7; term declared x5;
- label corrected: &lt;http://dbpedia.org/ontology/MeanOfTransportation&gt; &quot;has Aircraft&quot; is now &quot;mean of transportation&quot; - the label of hasAircraft, copied onto the class (duplicate_label); DBpedia labels the class &quot;mean of transportation&quot;@en
- header: dcterms:title &quot;Airline.owl Pattern&quot; - the library&apos;s name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library&apos;s description of the pattern
Each change is listed under &quot;curated&quot; in the pattern&apos;s metadata.json in OntoBoard&apos;s pattern library.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


